:::

::: {.column width="50%"}
- Each line is one level of the first IV (coffee). The x-axis is the second IV (TV).

- **Parallel** lines mean **no interaction**: the effect of one IV doesn't depend on the other.

- Here the lines are **not parallel**. Without coffee, TV drops happiness a lot (8.00 to 4.00). With coffee, TV matters much less (4.00 to 3.00). That is an interaction.
